href=\"/en/phuket-universe#homes\">Housing filters</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"pu-s098\" role=\"group\" aria-labelledby=\"rental-stage-2\"><h2 id=\"rental-stage-2\" class=\"pu-s105\">02 · Compare options</h2><p class=\"pu-s095\">Check your budget, lease term and questions before a viewing.</p><ul class=\"pu-s102\" role=\"list\"><li class=\"pu-s072\"><a class=\"pu-s082\" href=\"#rental-cost-compare\">Worked cost comparison</a></li><li class=\"pu-s072\"><a class=\"pu-s082\" href=\"/en/phuket-universe/rental-budget-calculator\">Open rental calculator</a></li><li class=\"pu-s072\"><a class=\"pu-s082\" href=\"/en/phuket-universe/rental-shortlist\">Personal rental shortlist</a></li><li class=\"pu-s072\"><a class=\"pu-s082\" href=\"#rental-viewing-checklist\">Viewing questions</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"pu-s098\" role=\"group\" aria-labelledby=\"rental-stage-3\"><h2 id=\"rental-stage-3\" class=\"pu-s105\">03 · Move-in</h2><p class=\"pu-s095\">Record condition, keys, inventory and meter readings.</p><ul class=\"pu-s102\" role=\"list\"><li class=\"pu-s072\"><a class=\"pu-s082\" href=\"/en/phuket-universe/rental-move-in\">Move-in checklist</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"pu-s098\" role=\"group\" aria-labelledby=\"rental-stage-4\"><h2 id=\"rental-stage-4\" class=\"pu-s105\">04 · Move-out</h2><p class=\"pu-s095\">Check the records, return of the property and the refund actually received.</p><ul class=\"pu-s102\" role=\"list\"><li class=\"pu-s072\"><a class=\"pu-s082\" href=\"/en/phuket-universe/rental-move-out\">Move-out and deposit reconciliation</a></li></ul></div></nav></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"pu-s039\" id=\"rental-search-plan\" aria-labelledby=\"rental-search-plan-title\">\n<div class=\"pu-s096 pu-pad\"><div class=\"pu-s097\">\n<div class=\"pu-s098\"><span class=\"pu-s014\">Before you search</span>\n<h2 class=\"pu-s099\" id=\"rental-search-plan-title\">Plan your rental search</h2>\n<p class=\"pu-s044\">Four steps before comparing long-term rentals. You can define your criteria even while the catalogue is empty.</p>\n<a class=\"pu-s082\" href=\"/en/phuket-universe#homes\">Go to housing filters</a>\n<p class=\"pu-s095\">A shortlist is not a reservation. Availability, price and terms need confirmation at the source.</p></div>\n<ol class=\"pu-s102\" role=\"list\">\n<li class=\"pu-s103\"><span class=\"pu-s104\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><div class=\"pu-s072\"><strong class=\"pu-s105\">Area and daily routes</strong><span class=\"pu-s106\">Compare journeys to work, school and everyday places. Choose a preferred area and a backup.</span></div></li>\n<li class=\"pu-s103\"><span class=\"pu-s104\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><div class=\"pu-s072\"><strong class=\"pu-s105\">Total monthly budget</strong><span class=\"pu-s106\">Add rent and separately billed services. Count the deposit and one-off charges separately.</span></div></li>\n<li class=\"pu-s103\"><span class=\"pu-s104\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><div class=\"pu-s072\"><strong class=\"pu-s105\">Term and conditions</strong><span class=\"pu-s106\">Check the rate for the exact 6- or 12-month term, the deposit and its return conditions.</span></div></li>\n<li class=\"pu-s103\"><span class=\"pu-s104\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><div class=\"pu-s072\"><strong class=\"pu-s105\">Check the source</strong><span class=\"pu-s106\">Before deciding, confirm current availability, price and terms on the agency&#x27;s site. An old card is not confirmation.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</div></div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"pu-s039\" id=\"area-compare\" aria-labelledby=\"area-compare-title\"><div class=\"pu-s096 pu-pad\"><div class=\"pu-s098\"><span class=\"pu-s014\">Choosing an area</span><h2 class=\"pu-s099\" id=\"area-compare-title\">Compare two areas</h2><p class=\"pu-s044\">Choose two areas for yourself. Tick only the conditions you have personally checked. Compare the conditions that matter to you, not the number of ticks.</p></div><div class=\"pu-s097\"><div class=\"pu-s098\" role=\"group\" aria-labelledby=\"area-compare-a\"><h3 class=\"pu-s105\" id=\"area-compare-a\">Area A</h3><ul class=\"pu-s102\" role=\"list\"><li class=\"pu-s103\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"area-compare-a-1\"><label class=\"pu-s106\" for=\"area-compare-a-1\">Checked the time and convenience of daily journeys.</label></li>\n<li class=\"pu-s103\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"area-compare-a-2\"><label class=\"pu-s106\" for=\"area-compare-a-2\">Checked walking routes and access to needed shops and services.</label></li>\n<li class=\"pu-s103\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"area-compare-a-3\"><label class=\"pu-s106\" for=\"area-compare-a-3\">Checked transport and ways to get home at the times that matter.</label></li>\n<li class=\"pu-s103\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"area-compare-a-4\"><label class=\"pu-s106\" for=\"area-compare-a-4\">Checked noise and lighting at relevant morning or evening times.</label></li>\n<li class=\"pu-s103\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"area-compare-a-5\"><label class=\"pu-s106\" for=\"area-compare-a-5\">Checked access to suitable internet and mobile coverage.</label></li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"pu-s098\" role=\"group\" aria-labelledby=\"area-compare-b\"><h3 class=\"pu-s105\" id=\"area-compare-b\">Area B</h3><ul class=\"pu-s102\" role=\"list\"><li class=\"pu-s103\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"area-compare-b-1\"><label class=\"pu-s106\" for=\"area-compare-b-1\">Checked the time and convenience of daily journeys.</label></li>\n<li class=\"pu-s103\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"area-compare-b-2\"><label class=\"pu-s106\" for=\"area-compare-b-2\">Checked walking routes and access to needed shops and services.</label></li>\n<li class=\"pu-s103\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"area-compare-b-3\"><label class=\"pu-s106\" for=\"area-compare-b-3\">Checked transport and ways to get home at the times that matter.</label></li>\n<li class=\"pu-s103\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"area-compare-b-4\"><label class=\"pu-s106\" for=\"area-compare-b-4\">Checked noise and lighting at relevant morning or evening times.</label></li>\n<li class=\"pu-s103\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"area-compare-b-5\"><label class=\"pu-s106\" for=\"area-compare-b-5\">Checked access to suitable internet and mobile coverage.</label></li></ul></div></div><p class=\"pu-s095\">This section does not send or store ticks on a server; your browser may restore them. Ticks do not confirm housing availability or quality.</p><a class=\"pu-s082\" href=\"/en/phuket-universe#homes\">Back to housing filters</a></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"pu-s039\" id=\"rental-cost-compare\" aria-labelledby=\"rental-cost-compare-title\"><div class=\"pu-s096 pu-pad\"><div class=\"pu-s097\"><div class=\"pu-s098\"><span class=\"pu-s014\">Worked example</span><h2 class=\"pu-s099\" id=\"rental-cost-compare-title\">Compare two rentals</h2><p class=\"pu-s044\">Fictional examples, not real listings or typical market terms.</p><p class=\"pu-s044\">Both examples have the same monthly total. Option B requires ฿22,000 less cash at move-in.</p><p class=\"pu-s095\">Move-in cash includes first month&#39;s rent, deposit and one-off charges. Utilities are billed later in this example. A deposit is not a monthly expense. Check payment dates and refund conditions in the actual agreement.</p><a class=\"pu-s082\" href=\"/en/phuket-universe#homes\">Back to housing filters</a></div><ol class=\"pu-s102\" role=\"list\"><li class=\"pu-s103\"><span class=\"pu-s104\" aria-hidden=\"true\">A</span><div class=\"pu-s072\"><strong class=\"pu-s105\">Option A</strong><span class=\"pu-s106\">Monthly rent: ฿28,000 · Monthly utilities and services: ฿3,000</span><strong>Monthly total: ฿31,000</strong><span class=\"pu-s106\">Refundable deposit: ฿56,000 · One-off charges: ฿2,000</span><strong>Cash needed at move-in: ฿86,000</strong></div></li>\n<li class=\"pu-s103\"><span class=\"pu-s104\" aria-hidden=\"true\">B</span><div class=\"pu-s072\"><strong class=\"pu-s105\">Option B</strong><span class=\"pu-s106\">Monthly rent: ฿30,000 · Monthly utilities and services: ฿1,000</span><strong>Monthly total: ฿31,000</strong><span class=\"pu-s106\">Refundable deposit: ฿30,000 · One-off charges: ฿4,000</span><strong>Cash needed at move-in: ฿64,000</strong></div></li></ol></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"pu-s039\" id=\"rental-viewing-checklist\" aria-labelledby=\"rental-viewing-checklist-title\"><div class=\"pu-s096 pu-pad\"><div class=\"pu-s097\"><div class=\"pu-s098\"><span class=\"pu-s014\">Before a viewing</span><h2 class=\"pu-s099\" id=\"rental-viewing-checklist-title\">Five questions about a rental</h2><p class=\"pu-s044\">Expand the questions and note the answers for yourself. Leave unknown answers open. This section neither sends messages nor stores your information.</p><p class=\"pu-s095\">This is a personal question list, not property verification, a reservation or a transaction guarantee.</p><a class=\"pu-s082\" href=\"/en/phuket-universe#homes\">Back to housing filters</a></div><ol class=\"pu-s102\" role=\"list\"><li class=\"pu-s103\"><span class=\"pu-s104\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><div class=\"pu-s072\"><details><summary class=\"pu-s105\">Is this property still available?</summary><p class=\"pu-s106\">Check the link, address or listing reference, available date and last confirmation. An old listing does not guarantee availability.</p></details></div></li>\n<li class=\"pu-s103\"><span class=\"pu-s104\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><div class=\"pu-s072\"><details><summary class=\"pu-s105\">What is the price for my rental term?</summary><p class=\"pu-s106\">Note the monthly price for your exact term, what is included, what is billed separately and when that price applies.</p></details></div></li>\n<li class=\"pu-s103\"><span class=\"pu-s104\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><div class=\"pu-s072\"><details><summary class=\"pu-s105\">How much cash is due before moving in?</summary><p class=\"pu-s106\">Separate the first payment, deposit, one-off charges and payment dates. Check the deposit refund conditions.</p></details></div></li>\n<li class=\"pu-s103\"><span class=\"pu-s104\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><div class=\"pu-s072\"><details><summary class=\"pu-s105\">What should I inspect in person?</summary><p class=\"pu-s106\">Check the condition, water, electricity, internet, noise, access and inventory. Ask who is responsible for repairs.</p></details></div></li>\n<li class=\"pu-s103\"><span class=\"pu-s104\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><div class=\"pu-s072\"><details><summary class=\"pu-s105\">Who signs the agreement and receives payment?</summary><p class=\"pu-s106\">Before paying, verify the recipient&#x27;s authority, written terms and whether payment details match the agreement. Do not transfer money solely on the basis of a listing.</p></details></div></li></ol></div></div></section>\n\n</main></div></body></html>\n", { status: 200, headers: {"Content-Type": "text/html; charset=utf-8", "Content-Security-Policy": "default-src 'none'; style-src 'self'; font-src 'none'; connect-src 'none'; form-action 'none'; base-uri 'none'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; worker-src 'none'", "X-Robots-Tag": "noindex, nofollow", "Cache-Control": "no-store", "X-Content-Type-Options": "nosniff", "X-Frame-Options": "DENY", "Referrer-Policy": "no-referrer", "Permissions-Policy": "camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()"} });
