+  return new Response("<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"noindex,nofollow\"><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Security-Policy\" content=\"default-src &#x27;none&#x27;; script-src &#x27;sha256-J3GeqCmOdDuDs0Wpclkx9LRbPk8Uz0JjtBQJ0Du57xA=&#x27;; style-src &#x27;self&#x27;; connect-src &#x27;none&#x27;; form-action &#x27;none&#x27;; base-uri &#x27;none&#x27;; object-src &#x27;none&#x27;\"><title>Move-in checklist</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/phuket-rental-assets/rental-move-in.css\" integrity=\"sha256-TEYJH0BdDJ9dxeoWUe3bPmaOcNrA2sstgld8jih4/FM=\"></head><body><a class=\"rental-skip-link\" href=\"#main\">Skip to main content</a><header class=\"rental-nav-header\"><nav><a href=\"/en/phuket-universe/rental-journey\">Back to rental journey</a><a href=\"/phuket-universe/rental-move-in\" lang=\"ru\">Русский</a></nav></header><main id=\"main\" tabindex=\"-1\"><h1>Move-in checklist</h1><p>Record each item&#x27;s status at handover. “Recorded” means you noted the outcome, not that the item is safe, satisfactory or agreed.</p><p>Personal marks are not a handover certificate, safety assurance or legal conclusion. Do not enter addresses, names, contact details or document data here.</p><h2>Item statuses</h2><ul class=\"counts\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"><li>Not checked: <strong data-count=\"0\">8</strong></li><li>Recorded: <strong data-count=\"1\">0</strong></li><li>Needs clarification: <strong data-count=\"2\">0</strong></li><li>Not applicable: <strong data-count=\"3\">0</strong></li></ul><ol class=\"items\" role=\"list\"><li><h3 id=\"item-1-label\">Keys and access</h3><p id=\"item-1-hint\">Check the number of keys, access cards and remotes handed over. Check normal entry and exit without tampering with locks.</p><select id=\"item-1\" aria-labelledby=\"item-1-label\" aria-describedby=\"item-1-hint\" autocomplete=\"off\"><option value=\"0\">Not checked</option><option value=\"1\">Recorded</option><option value=\"2\">Needs clarification</option><option value=\"3\">Not applicable</option></select></li><li><h3 id=\"item-2-label\">Property condition</h3><p id=\"item-2-hint\">Note existing damage, stains and signs of leaks. Take permitted photographs separately if needed.</p><select id=\"item-2\" aria-labelledby=\"item-2-label\" aria-describedby=\"item-2-hint\" autocomplete=\"off\"><option value=\"0\">Not checked</option><option value=\"1\">Recorded</option><option value=\"2\">Needs clarification</option><option value=\"3\">Not applicable</option></select></li><li><h3 id=\"item-3-label\">Inventory</h3><p id=\"item-3-hint\">Compare the handed-over items and their condition with the agreed inventory.</p><select id=\"item-3\" aria-labelledby=\"item-3-label\" aria-describedby=\"item-3-hint\" autocomplete=\"off\"><option value=\"0\">Not checked</option><option value=\"1\">Recorded</option><option value=\"2\">Needs clarification</option><option value=\"3\">Not applicable</option></select></li><li><h3 id=\"item-4-label\">Meters and services</h3><p id=\"item-4-hint\">Note accessible water and electricity readings, date and billing arrangements. Do not open equipment or electrical panels.</p><select id=\"item-4\" aria-labelledby=\"item-4-label\" aria-describedby=\"item-4-hint\" autocomplete=\"off\"><option value=\"0\">Not checked</option><option value=\"1\">Recorded</option><option value=\"2\">Needs clarification</option><option value=\"3\">Not applicable</option></select></li><li><h3 id=\"item-5-label\">Connectivity and appliances</h3><p id=\"item-5-hint\">Clarify internet activation and normal operation of accessible appliances. Do not perform hazardous tests.</p><select id=\"item-5\" aria-labelledby=\"item-5-label\" aria-describedby=\"item-5-hint\" autocomplete=\"off\"><option value=\"0\">Not checked</option><option value=\"1\">Recorded</option><option value=\"2\">Needs clarification</option><option value=\"3\">Not applicable</option></select></li><li><h3 id=\"item-6-label\">Documents received</h3><p id=\"item-6-hint\">Compare copies of agreed documents and receipts for payments already made. Do not mark missing documents as received.</p><select id=\"item-6\" aria-labelledby=\"item-6-label\" aria-describedby=\"item-6-hint\" autocomplete=\"off\"><option value=\"0\">Not checked</option><option value=\"1\">Recorded</option><option value=\"2\">Needs clarification</option><option value=\"3\">Not applicable</option></select></li><li><h3 id=\"item-7-label\">Reporting defects</h3><p id=\"item-7-hint\">Clarify whom to notify about defects, how to report them and how to record the response.</p><select id=\"item-7\" aria-labelledby=\"item-7-label\" aria-describedby=\"item-7-hint\" autocomplete=\"off\"><option value=\"0\">Not checked</option><option value=\"1\">Recorded</option><option value=\"2\">Needs clarification</option><option value=\"3\">Not applicable</option></select></li><li><h3 id=\"item-8-label\">Returning the property</h3><p id=\"item-8-hint\">Note the agreed key-return, inspection and settlement arrangements for move-out. This checklist does not replace the agreement.</p><select id=\"item-8\" aria-labelledby=\"item-8-label\" aria-describedby=\"item-8-hint\" autocomplete=\"off\"><option value=\"0\">Not checked</option><option value=\"1\">Recorded</option><option value=\"2\">Needs clarification</option><option value=\"3\">Not applicable</option></select></li></ol><p><button type=\"button\" id=\"reset\">Reset all marks</button></p><small>Local review draft: the tool does not store or send your marks. Your browser may restore values. Record important outcomes separately before leaving.</small></main><script src=\"/phuket-rental-assets/rental-move-in-1.js\" integrity=\"sha256-J3GeqCmOdDuDs0Wpclkx9LRbPk8Uz0JjtBQJ0Du57xA=\"></script></body></html>\n", { status: 200, headers: {"Content-Type": "text/html; charset=utf-8", "Content-Security-Policy": "default-src 'none'; scrip