+<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src &#x27;none&#x27;; script-src &#x27;sha256-F8c4FUkEODFSzThS2sd8K9EdzRb1kzGDJgGt485wgOk=&#x27;; style-src &#x27;self&#x27;; connect-src &#x27;none&#x27;; form-action &#x27;none&#x27;; base-uri &#x27;none&#x27;; object-src &#x27;none&#x27;"><title>Phuket rental budget calculator</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/phuket-rental-assets/rental-budget-calculator.css" integrity="sha256-1AkubXbgu3OiOSnFI0hNr4T5w9Kh1AgYhidErl9xnMs="></head><body><a class="rental-skip-link" href="#main">Skip to main content</a><main id="main" tabindex="-1"><h1>Phuket rental budget calculator</h1><p>Calculate monthly costs and cash needed at move-in. All amounts are in Thai baht. Enter your own terms, including zero when a cost does not apply.</p><fieldset><legend>THB</legend><div class="fields"><div class="field"><label for="rent">Monthly rent (THB)</label><input id="rent" type="number" inputmode="numeric" min="0" max="1000000000" step="1" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="status"></div><div class="field"><label for="utilities">Monthly utilities and services (THB)</label><input id="utilities" type="number" inputmode="numeric" min="0" max="1000000000" step="1" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="status"></div><div class="field"><label for="deposit">Refundable deposit (THB)</label><input id="deposit" type="number" inputmode="numeric" min="0" max="1000000000" step="1" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="status"></div><div class="field"><label for="oneoff">One-off charges (THB)</label><input id="oneoff" type="number" inputmode="numeric" min="0" max="1000000000" step="1" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="status"></div></div><label class="toggle"><input id="prepay" type="checkbox"> First month&#x27;s utilities are due before move-in</label><button id="example" type="button">Fictional example</button><button id="reset" type="button">Clear</button></fieldset><div class="results" aria-live="polite"><div><strong>Monthly total</strong><output id="monthly">—</output></div><div><strong>Cash needed at move-in</strong><output id="upfront">—</output></div></div><p id="status" role="status" data-invalid="Enter four whole amounts from 0 to ฿1,000,000,000. A blank field is not zero." data-ready="Calculation ready.">Enter four whole amounts from 0 to ฿1,000,000,000. A blank field is not zero.</p><p>The deposit is included only in move-in cash, not monthly expenditure. This calculation assumes one month of rent is due at move-in. Check any different payment dates in the agreement.</p><small>Local draft. This tool neither transmits nor stores your data. Your browser may restore values. This is not a listing, reservation or price confirmation.</small><nav class="tool-nav" aria-label="Rental tools"><p>Values are not transferred between pages. Note any amounts you need before navigating.</p><ul role="list"><li><a href="/en/phuket-universe/rental-shortlist">Personal rental shortlist</a></li><li><a href="/en/phuket-universe/rental-journey">Rental journey</a></li><li><a href="/phuket-universe/rental-budget-calculator" lang="ru">Русский</a></li></ul></nav></main><script src="/phuket-rental-assets/rental-budget-calculator-1.js" integrity="sha256-F8c4FUkEODFSzThS2sd8K9EdzRb1kzGDJgGt485wgOk="></script></body></html>
