-stage-2"><h2 id="rental-stage-2" class="pu-s105">02 · Compare options</h2><p class="pu-s095">Check your budget, lease term and questions before a viewing.</p><ul class="pu-s102" role="list"><li class="pu-s072"><a class="pu-s082" href="#rental-cost-compare">Worked cost comparison</a></li><li class="pu-s072"><a class="pu-s082" href="/en/phuket-universe/rental-budget-calculator">Open rental calculator</a></li><li class="pu-s072"><a class="pu-s082" href="/en/phuket-universe/rental-shortlist">Personal rental shortlist</a></li><li class="pu-s072"><a class="pu-s082" href="#rental-viewing-checklist">Viewing questions</a></li></ul></div><div class="pu-s098" role="group" aria-labelledby="rental-stage-3"><h2 id="rental-stage-3" class="pu-s105">03 · Move-in</h2><p class="pu-s095">Record condition, keys, inventory and meter readings.</p><ul class="pu-s102" role="list"><li class="pu-s072"><a class="pu-s082" href="/en/phuket-universe/rental-move-in">Move-in checklist</a></li></ul></div><div class="pu-s098" role="group" aria-labelledby="rental-stage-4"><h2 id="rental-stage-4" class="pu-s105">04 · Move-out</h2><p class="pu-s095">Check the records, return of the property and the refund actually received.</p><ul class="pu-s102" role="list"><li class="pu-s072"><a class="pu-s082" href="/en/phuket-universe/rental-move-out">Move-out and deposit reconciliation</a></li></ul></div></nav></div></div></section>
+
+<section class="pu-s039" id="rental-search-plan" aria-labelledby="rental-search-plan-title">
+<div class="pu-s096 pu-pad"><div class="pu-s097">
+<div class="pu-s098"><span class="pu-s014">Before you search</span>
