+<li class="pu-s103"><span class="pu-s104" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="pu-s072"><strong class="pu-s105">Term and conditions</strong><span class="pu-s106">Check the rate for the exact 6- or 12-month term, the deposit and its return conditions.</span></div></li>
