+</section>
+
+<section class="pu-s039" id="area-compare" aria-labelledby="area-compare-title"><div class="pu-s096 pu-pad"><div class="pu-s098"><span class="pu-s014">Choosing an area</span><h2 class="pu-s099" id="area-compare-title">Compare two areas</h2><p class="pu-s044">Choose two areas for yourself. Tick only the conditions you have personally checked. Compare the conditions that matter to you, not the number of ticks.</p></div><div class="pu-s097"><div class="pu-s098" role="group" aria-labelledby="area-compare-a"><h3 class="pu-s105" id="area-compare-a">Area A</h3><ul class="pu-s102" role="list"><li class="pu-s103"><input type="checkbox" id="area-compare-a-1"><label class="pu-s106" for="area-compare-a-1">Checked the time and convenience of daily journeys.</label></li>
+<li class="pu-s103"><input type="checkbox" id="area-compare-a-2"><label class="pu-s106" for="area-compare-a-2">Checked walking routes and access to needed shops and services.</label></li>
+<li class="pu-s103"><input type="checkbox" id="area-compare-a-3"><label class="pu-s106" for="area-compare-a-3">Checked transport and ways to get home at the times that matter.</label></li>
+<li class="pu-s103"><input type="checkbox" id="area-compare-a-4"><label class="pu-s106" for="area-compare-a-4">Checked noise and lighting at relevant morning or evening times.</label></li>
+<li class="pu-s103"><input type="checkbox" id="area-compare-a-5"><label class="pu-s106" for="area-compare-a-5">Checked access to suitable internet and mobile coverage.</label></li></ul></div>
+<div class="pu-s098" role="group" aria-labelledby="area-compare-b"><h3 class="pu-s105" id="area-compare-b">Area B</h3><ul class="pu-s102" role="list"><li class="pu-s103"><input type="checkbox" id="area-compare-b-1"><label class="pu-s106" for="area-compare-b-1">Checked the time and convenience of daily journeys.</label></li>
+<li class="pu-s103"><input type="checkbox" id="area-compare-b-2"><label class="pu-s106" for="area-compare-b-2">Checked walking routes and access to needed shops and services.</label></li>
+<li class="pu-s103"><input type="checkbox" id="area-compare-b-3"><label class="pu-s106" for="area-compare-b-3">Checked transport and ways to get home at the times that matter.</label></li>
+<li class="pu-s103"><input type="checkbox" id="area-compare-b-4"><label class="pu-s106" for="area-compare-b-4">Checked noise and lighting at relevant morning or evening times.</label></li>
+<li class="pu-s103"><input type="checkbox" id="area-compare-b-5"><label class="pu-s106" for="area-compare-b-5">Checked access to suitable internet and mobile coverage.</label></li></ul></div></div><p class="pu-s095">This section does not send or store ticks on a server; your browser may restore them. Ticks do not confirm housing availability or quality.</p><a class="pu-s082" href="/en/phuket-universe#homes">Back to housing filters</a></div></section>
+
+<section class="pu-s039" id="rental-cost-compare" aria-labelledby="rental-cost-compare-title"><div class="pu-s096 pu-pad"><div class="pu-s097"><div class="pu-s098"><span class="pu-s014">Worked example</span><h2 class="pu-s099" id="rental-cost-compare-title">Compare two rentals</h2><p class="pu-s044">Fictional examples, not real listings or typical market terms.</p><p class="pu-s044">Both examples have the same monthly total. Option B requires ฿22,000 less cash at move-in.</p><p class="pu-s095">Move-in cash includes first month&#39;s rent, deposit and one-off charges. Utilities are billed later in this example. A deposit is not a monthly expense. Check payment dates and refund conditions in the actual agreement.</p><a class="pu-s082" href="/en/phuket-universe#homes">Back to housing filters</a></div><ol class="pu-s102" role="list"><li class="pu-s103"><span class="pu-s104" aria-hidden="true">A</span><div class="pu-s072"><strong class="pu-s105">Option A</strong><span class="pu-s106">Monthly rent: ฿28,000 · Monthly utilities and services: ฿3,000</span><strong>Monthly total: ฿31,000</strong><span class="pu-s106">Refundable deposit: ฿56,000 · One-off charges: ฿2,000</span><strong>Cash needed at move-in: ฿86,000</strong></div></li>
+<li class="pu-s103"><span class="pu-s104" aria-hidden="true">B</span><div class="pu-s072"><strong class="pu-s105">Option B</strong><span class="pu-s106">Monthly rent: ฿30,000 · Monthly utilities and services: ฿1,000</span><strong>Monthly total: ฿31,000</strong><span class="pu-s106">Refundable deposit: ฿30,000 · One-off charges: ฿4,000</span><strong>Cash needed at move-in: ฿64,000</strong></div></li></ol></div></div></section>
+
+<section class="pu-s039" id="rental-viewing-checklist" aria-labelledby="rental-viewing-checklist-title"><div class="pu-s096 pu-pad"><div class="pu-s097"><div class="pu-s098"><span class="pu-s014">Before a viewing</span><h2 class="pu-s099" id="rental-viewing-checklist-title">Five questions about a rental</h2><p class="pu-s044">Expand the questions and note the answers for yourself. Leave unknown answers open. This section neither sends messages nor stores your information.</p><p class="pu-s095">This is a personal question list, not property verification, a reservation or a transaction guarantee.</p><a class="pu-s082" href="/en/phuket-universe#homes">Back to housing filters</a></div><ol class="pu-s102" role="list"><li class="pu-s103"><span class="pu-s104" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="pu-s072"><details><summary class="pu-s105">Is this property still available?</summary><p class="pu-s106">Check the link, address or listing reference, available date and last confirmation. An old listing does not guarantee availability.</p></details></div></li>
+<li class="pu-s103"><span class="pu-s104" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="pu-s072"><details><summary class="pu-s105">What is the price for my rental term?</summary><p class="pu-s106">Note the monthly price for your exact term, what is included, what is billed separately and when that price applies.</p></details></div></li>
+<li class="pu-s103"><span class="pu-s104" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="pu-s072"><details><summary class="pu-s105">How much cash is due before moving in?</summary><p class="pu-s106">Separate the first payment, deposit, one-off charges and payment dates. Check the deposit refund conditions.</p></details></div></li>
+<li class="pu-s103"><span class="pu-s104" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="pu-s072"><details><summary class="pu-s105">What should I inspect in person?</summary><p class="pu-s106">Check the condition, water, electricity, internet, noise, access and inventory. Ask who is responsible for repairs.</p></details></div></li>
+<li class="pu-s103"><span class="pu-s104" aria-hidden="true">5</span><div class="pu-s072"><details><summary class="pu-s105">Who signs the agreement and receives payment?</summary><p class="pu-s106">Before paying, verify the recipient&#x27;s authority, written terms and whether payment details match the agreement. Do not transfer money solely on the basis of a listing.</p></details></div></li></ol></div></div></section>
+
+</main></div></body></html>
