+<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src &#x27;none&#x27;; script-src &#x27;sha256-nOXXnTBO3cqUbEKDYP4rdqyn0AgVY4AP501kRVG2VRE=&#x27;; style-src &#x27;self&#x27;; connect-src &#x27;none&#x27;; form-action &#x27;none&#x27;; base-uri &#x27;none&#x27;; object-src &#x27;none&#x27;"><title>Move-out and deposit reconciliation</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/phuket-rental-assets/rental-move-out.css" integrity="sha256-QHSfKOEPQyQdcJ3Wb9rTnDngKAb4B8bv6nTfYS3+KFA="></head><body><a class="rental-skip-link" href="#main">Skip to main content</a><header class="rental-nav-header"><nav><a href="/en/phuket-universe/rental-journey">Back to rental journey</a><a href="/en/phuket-universe/rental-move-in">Move-in checklist</a><a href="/phuket-universe/rental-move-out" lang="ru">Русский</a></nav></header><main id="main" tabindex="-1"><h1>Move-out and deposit reconciliation</h1><p>Compare your entered refund calculation with the amount actually received. This is arithmetic, not a legal determination of debt. Entered deductions are not deemed agreed or lawful.</p><fieldset><legend>THB</legend><div class="fields"><label class="field" for="deposit"><span>Deposit paid (THB)</span><input id="deposit" type="number" min="0" max="1000000000" step="1" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off"></label><label class="field" for="deductions"><span>Deductions in the available calculation (THB)</span><input id="deductions" type="number" min="0" max="1000000000" step="1" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off"></label><label class="field" for="received"><span>Refund actually received (THB)</span><input id="received" type="number" min="0" max="1000000000" step="1" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off"></label></div><button id="example" type="button">Fictional example</button><button id="reset" type="button">Clear</button></fieldset><div class="results" aria-live="polite"><div><strong>Calculated refund</strong><output id="expected">—</output></div><div><strong>Calculated refund minus amount received</strong><output id="delta">—</output></div></div><p id="status" role="status">Enter all three amounts. A blank is unknown, not zero.</p><h2>Before returning the property</h2><details><summary>Move-out dates and procedure</summary><p>Check notice dates and procedure in your own agreement; do not rely on a universal notice period.</p></details><details><summary>Condition and inventory</summary><p>Compare the property with your move-in notes and record discrepancies.</p></details><details><summary>Meters and payments</summary><p>Compare meter readings, bills and amounts already paid.</p></details><details><summary>Inspection and keys</summary><p>Clarify inspection, key return and evidence of handover.</p></details><details><summary>Deposit refund</summary><p>Ask for an understandable breakdown of deductions and compare actual receipts with the records.</p></details><small>Local draft. Do not enter addresses, names, contacts or payment details. The tool does not send or store values. Your browser may restore fields. Not legal advice, a payment demand or refund confirmation.</small></main><div id="copy" hidden>{"title": "Move-out and deposit reconciliation", "intro": "Compare your entered refund calculation with the amount actually received. This is arithmetic, not a legal determination of debt. Entered deductions are not deemed agreed or lawful.", "fields": ["Deposit paid", "Deductions in the available calculation", "Refund actually received"], "expected": "Calculated refund", "delta": "Calculated refund minus amount received", "unknown": "Enter all three amounts. A blank is unknown, not zero.", "invalid": "Enter whole amounts from 0 to 1,000,000,000 THB.", "excess": "Deductions exceed the deposit. Reconcile the amounts separately; no result calculated.", "less": "Less was received than the calculated amount. Check the difference against the records.", "more": "More was received than the calculated amount. Check what the payments include.", "equal": "The entered amounts reconcile. This does not confirm final settlement.", "example": "Fictional example", "reset": "Clear", "checkTitle": "Before returning the property", "checks": [["Move-out dates and procedure", "Check notice dates and procedure in your own agreement; do not rely on a universal notice period."], ["Condition and inventory", "Compare the property with your move-in notes and record discrepancies."], ["Meters and payments", "Compare meter readings, bills and amounts already paid."], ["Inspection and keys", "Clarify inspection, key return and evidence of handover."], ["Deposit refund", "Ask for an understandable breakdown of deductions and compare actual receipts with the records."]], "guide": "Back to rental journey", "movein": "Move-in checklist", "other": "Русский", "privacy": "Local draft. Do not enter addresses, names, contacts or payment details. The tool does not send or store values. Your browser may restore fields. Not legal advice, a payment demand or refund confirmation."}</div><script src="/phuket-rental-assets/rental-move-out-1.js" integrity="sha256-nOXXnTBO3cqUbEKDYP4rdqyn0AgVY4AP501kRVG2VRE="></script></body></html>
